<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 5</span>: </span><span id="S4.F5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">CDFs of reconstruction error (CD, MHD). <span id="S4.F5.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">RadarSFD</span> achieves the steepest curves and lowest errors, outperforming RAL’24, RadarHD single-frame, and CFAR, with most samples under 0.5 m CD and 0.4 m MHD.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
